  "site_name": "",
  "description": "The proposal is for an internal refurbishment of 1 Devonshire Close, including a rear extension as well as a mansard roof extension. At ground level, the existing living room will become a TV room/snug. The laundry room, coat cupboard and bathroom will be re-planned where the existing kitchen is, \nincluding access to the new winter garden and patio. At first floor a new kitchen, living and dining space will take the place of the existing bedroom and en-suite facilities. Two bedrooms with en-suites will be located in a new traditional mansard roof at second level floor level. A new winter garden will lie at the rear of the building at terrace level, accessible from the ground floor. A new staircase from first floor to second floor travels up on the outside of the existing building, enclosed in glass and overlooking the green roof of the winter garden.",
